uld be great! Even if it's just static, I'd watch it!"},[v7("\27\229\230\138\16\237\230\145\29\238\240","\196\79\170\169")]={v7("\164\52\48\111\135\34\101\110\130\50\33\61\133\52\54\110\138\55\54\61\130\41\32\61\143\50\46\120\195\40\46\120\143\62\49\114\141\40\101\124\141\63\101\84\195\51\36\121\195\47\42\61\128\52\55\111\134\56\49\61\139\50\40\60\195\11\42\113\138\47\32\113\154\122","\29\227\91\69"),"Well— not all fossils are skeletal remains actually! Just most! Don't be discouraged!","It's not a bad thing! Variation in data is key to new discoveries!",v7("\248\192\171\160\160\95\119\220\206\178\190\183\6\58\218\143\147\187\183\85\119\249\192\173\161\173\74\62\222\193\255\242\141\6\63\222\217\187\242\165\6\35\214\219\178\183\229\6\22\159\223\177\190\173\82\50\159\192\176\183\229","\87\191\175\222\210\196\38"),v7("\114\168\103\247\206\222\88\225\121\162\203\207\64\168\117\231\215\218\86\250\55\242\209\203\64\237\101\244\194\218\90\231\121\162\204\202\87\251\55\246\203\207\93\168\117\237\205\203\64\169\55\199\213\199\87\237\121\225\198\145\19\222\126\224\198\221\18","\174\51\136\23\130\163"),v7("\26\26\39\24\230\236\125\28\33\74\246\253\56\85\48\15\241\225\125\22\61\6\237\224\47\85\61\4\162\225\53\16\114\12\238\250\50\7\115\74\193\250\51\19\59\14\231\251\41\85\61\24\227\251\58\16\115","\149\93\117\82\106\130"),v7("\207\253\9\233\199\226\253\58\233\222\244\185\4\166\196\232\184\93\224\202\229\169\93\231\197\226\253\20\235\198\227\185\20\231\223\227\177\4\166\202\246\178\17\233\204\239\167\24\226\139\224\178\15\166\194\242\252\93\214\217\233\186\15\227\216\245\252","\171\134\221\125\134"),"Gourdy's a gourd! Confident! Very calm! Nothing wobbling!"},[v7("\132\11\214\88\207\146\11\219\84\213\132\16\220","\144\208\68\153\22")]={"I can have my little side hobbies! Haha... don't you? Bobette gets it!","Bobette said she thought my thing was dinosaurs! It is! It's also sewing!","Bobette is so cozy! I want to be cozy! I'm nervous instead!","I'd sew Bobette a scarf! It would take three attempts! All worth it!","Craft toons keep the whole operation together! That's my thesis!",v7("\195\21\39\9\209\66\18\142\233\27\54\76\209\94\18\142\241\27\49\5\192\88\20\203\161\21\35\76\196\22\16\194\224\25\44\9\215\23\87\253\237\21\50\77\133\102\22\218\232\31\43\24\132\22\48\194\224\25\44\13\201\23","\174\129\122\69\108\165\54\119"),v7("\202\211\213\254\185\212\201\169\243\200\201\253\185\203\223\251\224\157\220\232\234\201\154\254\252\220\206\225\252\207\155\169\208\157\200\236\248\217\154\253\241\220\206\168\185\244\154\228\248\217\223\169\237\213\219\253\185\200\202\168","\137\153\189\186"),"I'm not old! That's— nobody said old! Sorry! Nevermind!"},[v7("\37\225\50\107\46\236\60\118\34\231\56","\37\113\174\125")]={v7("\102\69\77\189\16\4\10\231\31\102\69\186\66\77\65\233\86\75\80\233\92\93\4\167\80\73\65\233\67\77\67\161\69\5\4\144\94\81\4\174\94\80\4\164\72\4\74\168\92\65\4\187\88\67\76\189\16","\201\49\36\36"),"We're for sure friends! Of course! Just us Mains! Hahaha!",v7("\38\47\185\99\13\43\234\121\23\110\171\48\2\39\185\120\69\110\140\121\23\38\234\113\22\43\234\127\8\42\175\98\68\58\162\113\10\110\190\98\1\43\185\49\68\7\234\115\12\43\169\123\1\42\235\48\48\57\163\115\1\111","\16\100\78\202"),v7("\148\252\120\247\149\71\11\165\184\170\117\228\195\64\78\174\179\252\100\249\195\86\67\174\253\179\115\243\130\76\10\235\148\252\120\247\149\71\11\169\184\185\126\182\151\77\11\170\253\184\121\241\195\81\66\191\184\253\48\197\138\79\66\167\188\174\48\242\150\81\95\234","\203\221\220\16\150\227\34\43"),v7("\221\45\104\112\187\44\122\110\254\100\121\125\254\42\59\121\233\43\110\118\255\100\125\119\233\33\109\125\233\101\59\75\243\43\108\53\244\34\125\107\186\100\76\119\245\32\126\106\253\49\119\57","\24\155\68\27"),v7("\147\86\144\112\187\67\195\91\191\16\199\83\180\68\195\18\174\95\144\90\191\81\194\18\187\82\223\71\174\16\196\90\191\16\244\87\172\95\222\91\187\94\156\18\147\16\216\83\172\85\144\83\250\68\209\94\177\17\144\98\168\85\192\83\168\85\212\19\250\118\223\64\183\81\196\70\191\84\145","\50\218\48\176"),"Bassie has scales, I have a shell! We're both wearing the correct outfit!","I almost said something and then didn't! That's normal! That's a normal thing I do!"},[v7("\125\98\230\217\117\96\113\125\250","\52\46\50\180\144\59")]={"Sprinting! Or— whatever that was! It was fast! I noticed the fast!","Ooo, speed! I'm not built for speed! I'm built for gently holding small bones!","Go! Go! I'll keep up! I won't keep up! But I'll keep going!","That's the fast one! I remember the fast one! I've read about velocity!","Careful on the corners! Actually— don't be careful! Be fast! Sorry!","You're so quick! I'm the slow one of the team and I've made peace with it!","Fast fast fast! That's the whole sentence! I panicked!",v7("\63\36\43\55\10\48\241\8\113\36\55\33\56\246\1\56\40\126\11\44\233\76\113\17\127\3\32\186\26\52\55\114\70\59\239\4\61\49\55\0\54\232\77\56\49\54\70\0\245\24\113\41\120\9\50\186\15\36\44\123\18\121\252\2\35\101\126\18\120","\154\109\81\69\23\102\89"),"If you get too far ahead I'll just— narrate! From back here! Cheerfully!","Speed without stamina! That's the dream! That's actually my dream!","I'm impressed and slightly dizzy! Mostly impressed!"},[v7("\201\251\238\125\111\13\197\228\250\114","\89\154\171\188\52\33")]={"Slower now? Good! I mean— not good! Just easier to keep up with!",v7("\212\21\15\61\182\0\3\118\248\27\30\59\247\24\76\33\247\24\7\63\248\19\77\118\216\27\30\59\247\24\76\63\229\84\1\47\182\18\13\32\249\1\30\63\226\17\76\37\230\17\9\50\183\84\34\57\182\27\10\48\243\26\15\51\182\0\3\118\240\21\31\34\183","\86\150\116\108"),v7("\88\180\45\183\128\6\68\179\35\185\200\72\112\255\40\161\214\72\54\255\1\183\129\74\114\184\63\238\210\71\110\255\56\166\192\72\124\255\53\161\212\7\55\150\108\189\192\95\55\171\36\175\207\77\55\166\35\187\128","\38\23\223\76\206\161"),v7("\225\198\77\123\176\190\201\200\217\93\63\226\234\225\202\204\89\47\226\234\232\215\221\24\60\177\175\199\204\136\24\21\166\1