 that look intentional! Was it? Doesn't matter! Great!",v7("\13\238\136\67\186\4\126\196\130\91\163\68\50\165\146\68\191\73\50\164\193\97\185\81\126\233\148\76\189\4\126\200\142\92\162\73\39\165\143\64\162\5\50\240\130\68\247\5\25\247\132\78\162\4","\37\94\133\225\47\214"),v7("\120\219\89\31\23\247\90\91\86\218\23\30\116\216\83\95\89\209\68\30\67\220\87\80\23\217\79\30\81\219\69\77\94\216\22\78\69\209\70\31\23\249\67\93\95\148\85\82\82\213\88\91\69\149","\62\55\180\54"),"I'd clap but I'm using my hands to be nervous!"},[v7("\207\205\1\245\118\97\138","\123\155\154\72\166\34\36\206")]={"Twisted! That's a twisted! It's— it's over there! I'm pointing! Can you see the pointing?!",v7("\233\212\57\186\100\134\253\49\164\101\213\220\57\177\60\134\208\54\166\100\134\241\61\180\101\214\211\57\173\100\134\236\57\174\32\134\207\52\162\43\135\159\11\183\36\223\159\54\166\36\212\159\53\166\100\134\240\42\227\36\209\222\33\226\101\231\200\57\186\101\207\204\120\165\44\200\218\121","\69\166\191\88\195"),"I'm not panicking! I'm doing the calm version of panicking!","It's close! It's very close! I've stopped enjoying this!","Don't look at it! Or do! I don't know how twisted eyes work! Just move!","Hide! Somewhere! Anywhere! I'll hide too! We'll hide separately!","That one has teeth! Most of them do! I checked! It wasn't helpful!",v7("\148\99\110\71\158\166\43\152\173\115\61\71\198\191\61\202\191\117\61\81\143\186\61\203\249\84\33\86\198\162\38\131\170\59\110\118\142\191\61\202\176\105\110\77\147\162\61\131\189\127\110\79\159\246\43\146\169\127\60\86\143\165\43\203","\234\217\26\78\34\230\214\78"),"Run in a— a zigzag! No, straight! Straight is faster! Sorry!","I'm being brave! This is what brave looks like on me! It's shaky!"},[v7("\149\51\205\97\107\132\48\218","\42\208\127\136\55")]={v7("\69\80\204\105\163\224\74\103\89\221\38\180\173\15\66\89\207\44\178\245\15\101\77\203\44\231\172\102\49\84\198\63\163\172\91\121\93\137\58\167\234\74\101\65\137\61\179\238\74\48","\47\17\56\169\73\